# Backlog gates

Do **not** implement these until Joe asks, or you are continuing an active task he already started:

| Backlog | Detail rule (read when working on it) | Chat |
|---------|--------------------------------------|------|
| Alive UX Phases A–F | `.cursor/rules/alive-product-ux-backlog.mdc` | matching page chat |
| Auth / Apple+Google login | `.cursor/rules/auth-login-backlog.mdc` | `Login & Settings` |
| Sales pitch deck | `.cursor/rules/pitch-deck-vision.mdc` | `Pitch Deck` |
| Cash / insurance contracts | `.cursor/rules/legal-contracts-backlog.mdc` | `Contracts` |
| Canvassing phone / skip-trace | `.cursor/rules/canvassing-phone-lookup-backlog.mdc` | `Canvassing` |

**Alive UX gate order:** (1) UI color direction locked, (2) deep scan / lock pass, (3) then phases A→F. Smaller items (IR smoke, whiteboard labor, missing prices Joe confirms) may proceed earlier if he asks.

**Money:** Never invent prices or coverage numbers. Leave blanks blank until Joe confirms.

When Joe opens backlog work, `@` the detail rule or read it from the path above.
